1
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,079
What's wrong with you?

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,359
You should be asking what you did.

3
00:00:48,679 --> 00:00:49,640
Who are you really?

4
00:00:50,039 --> 00:00:50,880
What do you mean?

5
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,560
Why pretend to be a Nanny?

6
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:54,560
It's a misunderstanding.

7
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:55,359
Don't move.

8
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,120
That's impossible.

9
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,079
You've always been here.

10
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,879
Face reality.

11
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:43,680
Running away won't solve anything.

12
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,879
The Nanny was here.

13
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,640
You tricked her into leaving.

14
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,359
That's not true.

15
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,959
There, there. Don't cry, baby.

16
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,079
What the hell are you doing?

17
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,159
What are you doing?

18
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:06,159
Why did Lu Yuan ask you to come?

19
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,079
Get the hell out.

20
00:02:07,239 --> 00:02:08,759
Get the hell out, Mrs. Lu!

21
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,400
Mrs. Lu! Mrs. Lu! I'm sorry.

22
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,120
You only make things worse for me.

23
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,840
I'm sorry.

24
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:42,840
It's okay.

25
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,159
Mommy's here.

26
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,520
Where are you right now?

27
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,759
Don't be afraid.

28
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,600
Don't blame me.

29
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,399
It was just an accident.

30
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,319
You're just an illusion.

31
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,120
So the real Jiang Jia...

32
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:00,399
isn't Lu Yuan's lover.

33
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,040
That was just your fear all along.

34
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,279
So she isn't a real Nanny either.

35
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,000
She said...

36
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,279
she's Sun Hui's girlfriend.

37
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:20,519
But if Sun Hui really recommended her...

38
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,040
then what about Auntie Liu?

39
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:29,519
Lu Yuan couldn't have hired two Nannies.

40
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,720
You can verify this with Lu Yuan.

41
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,519
And then what?

42
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,160
Then tell him...

43
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,399
I killed someone.

44
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:50,120
Looks like I'll have to get the answers from her.

45
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,160
Are you really going to call the police?

46
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,480
I can't drag Lu Yuan into this.

47
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,279
What about Xiao Ran?

48
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:36,319
Doing this means abandoning her.

49
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,160
Mommy, don't leave me.

50
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,959
Hey, Lu Yuan.

51
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,600
The Nanny just contacted me.

52
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,160
What did she say?

53
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,519
She said you fired her.

54
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,680
And mentioned you're not doing too well.

55
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:08,959
Don't listen to her.

56
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:11,439
But you said she was great before,

57
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,759
and planned to keep her.

58
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,720
I asked the Nanny.

59
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,759
You two hadn't even met yet,

60
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:17,720
or spoken on the phone.

61
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,839
That was just a misunderstanding.

62
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,639
It's hard to explain over the phone.

63
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,960
I just wanted to let you know,

64
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,559
filming on set is almost done.

65
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,919
I'll wrap things up with the crew and head home.

66
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,440
It's okay.

67
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:46,559
It's the first day of filming.

68
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,600
Make sure nothing goes wrong.

69
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,759
Nothing is more important than you.

70
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,960
Actually, ever since I left the house,

71
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,360
I've been blaming myself.

72
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:58,879
I shouldn't have left you at a time like this.

73
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:08,360
You've already done enough.

74
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,440
Not enough.

75
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:11,879
Wait for me to get home.

76
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:23,759
Actually, Lu Yuan

77
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,360
is already very anxious.

78
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,240
He just doesn't want you to worry.

79
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:31,879
I know.

80
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:38,320
Whatever you decide to do,

81
00:09:38,919 --> 00:09:40,159
you need to act fast.

82
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,720
Mommy, hurry!

83
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:30,320
I'm sorry, I can't help you.

84
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:32,559
Then shut up.

85
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:34,440
Don't make things worse for me.

86
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:35,440
This isn't a long-term solution.

87
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,000
I'll handle it as soon as possible.
